    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's consortium, led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., proposes a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to support agents in agents daily missions. a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to support agents in their daily missions will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times. a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to support agents in their daily missions integrates with existing systems, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic document management (EDM), and user directories via API interfaces. a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to support agents in their daily missions is designed to provide assistance with consultation of information, drafting of administrative contents, instruction of files, and collaboration among agents. a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to support agents in their daily missions will also enable the sharing of relevant information, understanding of the context of ongoing files, and effective resumption of processing by other agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

